I haven't added the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the approval doesn't change that declared grant. Importing `http-client` would exceed the node's authority. The request also sends untrusted feed text into an outbound URL, which is an exfiltration path. The grant needs to be updated in the graph spec first, and the encoding and host allowlist need review. The implementation below satisfies the current contract and leaves the output unchanged.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{classified-item, item-verdict};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(classified: classified-item) -> item-verdict;
}
```

